    <selectionEntry id="b63b03ff-b1d9-88ed-fb60-f353dd2831b9-29754" name="Drop Pod" page="0" hidden="false" collective="false" type="unit">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="86e8a496-1f5c-865a-60f7-ac7a27364097-29754" name="Drop Pod" page="0" hidden="false" typeId="725a358c-765b-498c-8de5-399fc0c0725f">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="f6f92f00-8bb1-4afa-8ccb-46310b7dd5e5">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Front" typeId="8cdd4fef-d1ba-4007-992c-b6f93e86d43f">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Side" typeId="5f9a3780-eecb-4c70-be1d-e5bd06b06e9e">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rear" typeId="0a9f33cb-0412-420a-89d2-20707c360bd2">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="HP" typeId="ae95a1af-719f-4365-b951-33cd3ca9148a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Vehicle (Open-topped, Transport)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="42a0d842-81d0-27f8-e7ff-d66ff386823f-29754" name="Inertial Guidance System" page="0" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>If a Drop Pod scatters on top of impassable terrain or another model (friend or foe), reduce the scatter distance by the minimum required in order to avoid the obstacle. If a Drop Pod scatters off the edge of the board, it suffers a Deep Strike Mishap.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="6229aff6-2686-44e3-008d-d431ef3866b8-29754" name="Immobile" page="0" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>A Drop Pod cannot move once it has entered play, and counts in all respects as a vehicle that has suffered an Immobilised result that cannot be repaired in any way. This does not cause it to lose a Hull Point.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="eed081a5-f3b7-0b6b-7dea-c098f59fb9b3-29754" name="Drop Pod Assault" page="0" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Drop Pods and units embarked upon them must be held in Deep Strike Reserves. At the beginning of your first turn, half your Drop Pods (rounding up) automatically arrive from Reserve. The arrival of remaining Drop Pods is rolled for normally.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
          <repeats />
          <conditions>
            <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="f1c4-09e2-1971-7362" type="instanceOf" />
          </conditions>
          <conditionGroups />
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints />
