          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="94ed77ef-0925-fa31-98a9-78aa39956a93-29754" name="Finest Hour" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
              <profiles>
                <profile id="287dfa25-ae5a-c2ae-7baa-b8d094b88b3e-29754" name="Sons of the Primarch: Blood Angels" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82">
                  <profiles />
                  <rules />
                  <infoLinks />
                  <modifiers />
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Flying Monstrous Creature</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <rules>
                <rule id="5d661e70-63cb-9465-f89f-c98e39f16bb2-29754" name="Finest Hour" hidden="false">
                  <profiles />
                  <rules />
                  <infoLinks />
                  <modifiers />
                  <description>Once per game, at the start of any of their turns, a player may choose to take his Warlord's Finest Hour. The warlord has a 3++ and Eternal Warrior and is allowed to order an All-out Attack. Furthermore you may roll on the Exemplar Tables or use the Sons of the Primarch-rule. These effects last until the Warlord's next turn.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <infoLinks />
              <modifiers />
              <constraints>
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="94ed77ef-0925-fa31-98a9-78aa39956a93-minSelections-29754" type="min" />
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="94ed77ef-0925-fa31-98a9-78aa39956a93-maxSelections-29754" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <selectionEntries />
              <selectionEntryGroups />
              <entryLinks />
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" value="0.0" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" />
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="62d84aad-e5c1-a3ab-70a9-b0aa8f04ea33-29754" name="Divine Intervention" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
              <profiles />
              <rules>
                <rule id="913f9f96-6519-1c20-2e98-bf38e40c2602-29754" name="For The Emperor!" hidden="false">
                  <profiles />
                  <rules />
                  <infoLinks />
                  <modifiers />
                  <description>If at least half the units in your army have been removed as casualties, you may invoke Divine Intervention. Untill end of turn, all units from the Blood Angel-Faction have Furious Charge and Fearless. Use this power only once per game.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <infoLinks />
              <modifiers />
              <constraints>
