            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">Tycho's close combat attacks ignore armour saves and roll an additional D6 for armour penetration. The Dead Man's Hand also includes a set of digital weapons, allowing Tycho to re-roll a single failed roll to wound each Assault phase.</characteristic>
