                                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">All friendly units within 12" of the standard bearer re-rolls failed Morale and Pinning tests. In addition, while the standard bearer is alive, the Honour guard counts as scoring one extra wound in close combat for the purposes of calculating the assault results.</characteristic>
